# Control-channel script for this app's net row (sim-run.sh::run_test; hil-run
# skips rows with one): press X once the screen is up, wait for the reply,
# then Y twice — the first clears the reply, the second is BACK with nothing
# to clear, which finishes the Activity and ends the row the way a term row does.
wait AskClaude[]:] ready
sleep 1
input keyevent 23
wait AskClaude[]:] usage: ok
sleep 1
input back
sleep 1
input back
